name: Curated operational tools and honest historical shard progress
size: 120x36
cwd: @TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/module_audit_readers.py @TARGET @ART before
launch: --target @TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | recovered-investigation
submit: coverage
wait: 0.5
require-live-snap: 30 HISTORICAL SHARD PROGRESS | historical-progress
expect: 6 preparation, unclassified or non-shard job(s) excluded
expect: not repository coverage
nav-mode:
ask: Does the historical reader disclose excluded modern studies and avoid claiming source coverage or inventing a column?
resize: 160x48
live-snap: progress-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: progress-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: progress-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: progress-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: progress-40x12
keys: NPage
wait: 0.2
live-snap: progress-page-1-40x12
keys: NPage
wait: 0.2
live-snap: progress-page-2-40x12
keys: NPage
wait: 0.2
live-snap: progress-tail-40x12
ask: Is the compatibility reader readable by paging at all six sizes, with historical limitations and the supported study/report route reachable?
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
submit: report
require-live-snap: 30 4 committed / 6 calls | original-investigation-report
expect: 2 reviewed
expect: 4 producer observations
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/module_audit_readers.py @TARGET @ART after
ask: Does Report retain the original scan, decisions and budget after operational reads, without model requests or new scan work?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
